[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16442.07, "timestamp": "04:34:02", "text": "现在直播也开始了。事情就是这样。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16447.029, "timestamp": "04:34:07", "text": "是的。你好。你好先生，我刚才正在给"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16449.67, "timestamp": "04:34:09", "text": "为人们提供背景信息。或许有人进来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16452.23, "timestamp": "04:34:12", "text": "通过观察吞噬，但他们只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16453.91, "timestamp": "04:34:13", "text": "正在寻找。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16457.189, "timestamp": "04:34:17", "text": "是的。我只是提供一些背景信息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16460.15, "timestamp": "04:34:20", "text": "是的。是的。我也这么做了。是的。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16461.54, "timestamp": "04:34:21", "text": "就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16463.349, "timestamp": "04:34:23", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16470.869, "timestamp": "04:34:30", "text": "所以你什么时候想要原神？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16474.869, "timestamp": "04:34:34", "text": "下周。随时都喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16477.109, "timestamp": "04:34:37", "text": "星期二，星期一。你甚至都做不到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16483.029, "timestamp": "04:34:43", "text": "周一。根钦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16485.429, "timestamp": "04:34:45", "text": "当然。当然。哦，等等。下周是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16488.39, "timestamp": "04:34:48", "text": "等等，下周不是就结束了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16491.029, "timestamp": "04:34:51", "text": "哦，不。不是这个。好的。好的。有"}]